    <text>
        <body>
            <div xml:id="d57">

                <pb facs="0078" n="66" sameAs="frus:frus1940v03/pg66"/>

                <note rend="inline" type="source">811.34544/1<hi rendition="#superscript">7/12</hi>:
                    Telegram</note>
                <head>
                    <hi rendition="#italic">The Ambassador in the United Kingdom</hi> (<hi rendition="#italic">Kennedy</hi>) <hi
                        rendition="#italic">to the Secretary of State
                    </hi>
                </head>
                <opener>
                    <dateline rendition="#float-right">
                        <placeName>
                            <hi rendition="#small-caps">London</hi></placeName>, <date
                            calendar="gregorian" when="1940-08-14T12:00:00+01:00">August 14,
                            1940—noon</date>.<lb/>[Received August 14—6:50 a.m.]</dateline>
                </opener>
                <p>2711. Your 2316, August 13, 6 p.m. It would be helpful to me here if I could know
                    the gist of Lothian’s message of August 8.</p>
                <closer>
                    <signed>
                        <hi rendition="#small-caps">Kennedy</hi>
                    </signed>
                </closer>
            </div>
        </body>
